ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186064408 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "22bb5766-c513-5d78-a9f8-52a5e929a9f8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064889 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186063390 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064889 #edb/ref 1069 "q-51102" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064889 #edb/ref 1071 "What is $\\displaystyle \\int(2e^{x} + 4^{x} - 2x)dx$?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064889 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c5ef23df-cb86-53d4-a2bd-c06a8017fa2b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065007 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065008 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065007 #edb/ref 1061 1369 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065007 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "fc7af3af-558f-5f0f-9b14-e5c45f77ad79" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065007 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186065407 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065008 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065009 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065008 #edb/ref 1061 1370 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065008 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3b0b5798-a45c-58ad-a6a5-18ca5ba2df53" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065008 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064171 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065009 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065010 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065009 #edb/ref 1061 1374 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065009 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "51842b79-1471-58e3-8240-0e6f8c062fda" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065009 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186065408 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065016 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1061 1377 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6e6c41bb-fda0-558d-bff8-d7d5bc882df6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064172 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065016 #edb/ref 1061 1379 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065016 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c64b94e8-f57d-5360-9a8d-ce365fb8c43d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065016 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064177 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1064 "Remember that the exponential function $e^x$ has the special property that the derivative of the exponential function is the exponential function itself. In other words, taking the derivative doesn't change anything, and we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm d x} \\left(e^ x\\right)  = e^ x.\n$$\n\nSince integration is the opposite of differentiation, and differentiating the exponential function leaves it unchanged, integrating the exponential function also leaves it unchanged. So, the integral of the exponential function is\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int e^x \\, \\textrm d x = e^x +C.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1065 711 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "d2a6d036-0881-5a58-8935-905cd004a7e1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1064 "Remember that if $a$ is a positive real number, then the derivative of $a^x$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm d x}\\left( a^ x\\right)\t=\ta^ x \\ln a.\n$$\n\nSo, by \"reversing\" this process, we obtain the following formula for the integral of a general exponential function:\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int  a^x \\, \\textrm d x  = \\dfrac{a^ x }{\\ln a} +C.\n$$\n\nFor instance, suppose that we wish to calculate the integral \n\n$$\n\\int 2^x  \\, \\textrm d x\n$$\n\nTo compute the integral of a general exponential function, we just need to divide by the natural logarithm of the base of the exponential function:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\\int 2^x  \\, \\textrm d x   &= \\dfrac{2^x}{\\ln 2} + C\n}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1065 714 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "254d6a12-01a6-5a3b-b0fd-fbefc017a149" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1067 "Integrating an Exponential Function With a General Base" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247614 #edb/ref 1080 "{(\\frac{1}{8})}^{x}ln⁡8+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247614 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247614 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "14fd8908-86c1-5758-81a1-2ec277f68aa3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247681 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{{(\\frac{1}{8})}^{x}}{ln⁡8}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247681 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186247681 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1d42c3ea-2473-5c66-8a3d-af03c336005b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248162 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{ln⁡x}{ln⁡8}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248162 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248162 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5253b616-1982-56f6-8a9e-7ac1838f5f20" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248222 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{ln⁡x}{{8}^{x}}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248222 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248222 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "57f12027-6306-5a43-b276-eb500592f0a8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248544 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{{8}^{x}}{ln⁡8}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248544 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186248544 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7f8980f3-ea7f-50a6-9c9c-7812ebfc0549" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186247614 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186247681 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186248162 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186248222 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186248544 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186247681 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186249920 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8d70d61a-ae6a-57e0-bc6d-72a634f609db" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186250132 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186249920 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186250132 #edb/ref 1069 "q-113893" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186250132 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186250132 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate $\\int {(\\frac{1}{8})}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186250132 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "89cd3b1f-2f20-5813-8f46-6c4d05bd7fcb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186250132 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute the integral of a general exponential function, we just need to divide by the natural logarithm of the base of the exponential function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {(\\frac{1}{8})}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{{(\\frac{1}{8})}^{x}}{ln⁡(\\frac{1}{8})}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the laws of logarithms, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ln⁡(\\frac{1}{8}) & =ln⁡1-ln⁡8 \\\\  & =0-ln⁡8 \\\\  & =-ln⁡8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can simplify our final answer as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{(\\frac{1}{8})}^{x}}{ln⁡(\\frac{1}{8})}+C=-\\frac{{(\\frac{1}{8})}^{x}}{ln⁡8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186288280 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{{9}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡9}+3{e}^{x}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186288280 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186288280 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "25701e43-e3df-5d1e-8ac3-09bcc9dcf7bb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186288662 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡9}{{9}^{x}}+{e}^{x}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186288662 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186288662 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5a21abb6-314e-594e-906a-fc211f164a2f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186289408 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{{x}^{9}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡9}-3{e}^{x}+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186289408 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186289408 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ce26c9e7-48dc-50a0-bce8-7f40380eb504" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186289424 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{9}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}+{e}^{3